      "authorImage": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_kGiI2eg3s8xfy-RvTFMxOslfQH4mF9FX8eB0xUiEU=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj",
      "text": "この長くて周りが殺風景な道路走りたい😄",
