      "author": "@R134boy",
      "authorImage": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_mwgCqqNyA9CH27-_nU-b_sggSpmf-OdEtClwXqDXuczQ=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj",
      "text": "今イチバン人気がある馬は、ジュウリョクピエロかな？　明日京都競馬場で走ります",
      "likeCount": 0,
      "publishedAt": "2026-11-14T13:09:01Z",
